# Local-only overrides. Personal configuration must never reach this PUBLIC
# repo: keep values here (ignored) and commit only the .example template that
# documents the shape. For settings that should be VERSION CONTROLLED rather
# than merely ignored, track the app's plist in a PRIVATE dotfiles repo
# (chezmoi) instead — git has no per-file "tracked but not pushed" mode.
